{{!-- V2 single-root part for the vehicle / ACPA actor sheet. Renders the ACPA layout for powered
     armor, otherwise the plain-vehicle layout, by including the matching sub-template as a
     Handlebars partial (both registered via preloadHandlebarsTemplates). This wrapper div is the
     part's single root element, which ApplicationV2's HandlebarsApplicationMixin requires.
     ⭐ The branch reads the sheet context's RESOLVED FACE (isACPAFace / useCivilianSheet), not the
     raw stored flags: a compendium-deployed vehicle derives its face from its own data, and one
     resolver (module/vehicle/vehicle-face.js) settles both the derived and the designated case. --}}
<div class="cp-vehicle-sheet-root flexcol" style="flex:1;min-height:0;">
{{#if isACPAFace}}
{{> "modules/cp2020-augmented/templates/actor/acpa-sheet.hbs"}}
{{else}}{{#if useCivilianSheet}}
{{!-- Civilian (default) layout: mirrors the vehicle ITEM sheet so a deployed vehicle looks like
     the sheet users already know. The MM combat layout is the specialist view, selected by the
     per-vehicle isMMVehicle designation under the world MM gate (context useCivilianSheet). --}}
{{> "modules/cp2020-augmented/templates/actor/vehicle-civilian-sheet.hbs"}}
{{else}}
{{> "modules/cp2020-augmented/templates/actor/vehicle-sheet.hbs"}}
{{/if}}{{/if}}
</div>
